blocks.en:
Organization. We organize the appendix by question:
Sec. A gives implementation details;
Sec. B builds the ViT-S Base for small-encoder ablations;
Sec. C visualizes TAB on the ViT-B Base;
Sec. D tests causal use of predicted futures (TAB/status off);
Sec. E contrasts Full (WM+TAB+status) with Base+TAB;
Sec. F varies multi-scale future-query sets;
Sec. G repeats WM/TAB factorials at ViT-S and ViT-L;
Sec. H isolates stop-gradient routing for future latent injection;
Sec. I probes trajectory readability under a frozen backbone;
Sec. J checks scene grounding via an RGB readout;
Sec. K lists parameter counts for the main accuracy–size plot.

blocks.zh:
组织。 我们按问题编排附录:
师曰. A提供实施细节;
B. 建造用于小编码器喷发的VIT-S基地;
C. 视像Vit-B基地的TAB;
Sec. D测试预测期货的因果利用(TAB/状态关闭);
e. 与 Base+TAB 相对全(WM+TAB+状态);
f. 具有多种规模的未来结水装置;
g. 在Vit-S和Vit-L重复WM/TAB因子;
Sec. H隔离断流路径,供未来潜在注射使用;
Sec. 我在冷冻的骨干下探测轨迹可读性;
秘密J检查场景通过RGB读取屏蔽;
Sec. K 列出主精度–大小图的参数计数.
